NC Digital provides local SEO services for businesses in Neath — helping you rank higher on Google when people across Neath Port Talbot search for your services.

## Why local SEO matters for Neath businesses

Neath sits between Swansea and Port Talbot — which means your potential customers might search "builder Neath", "solicitor Neath Port Talbot", or even "restaurant near me". Local SEO makes sure your business appears when they do.

## What's included in our local SEO service

- Local keyword research — the exact terms your customers search
